() Tj T*
(Through the common market place provided by an exchange, on the other) Tj T*
(hand, market conditions and prices become common knowledge almost) Tj T*
(instantly over the entire country. This tends toward stabilization--a) Tj T*
(fact which, alone, helps to eliminate risks, and enables merchants to) Tj T*
(buy at lower prices than if forced to deal direct with one another.) Tj T*
(Sellers do not have to take such long chances and can thus afford to) Tj T*
(sell on a smaller margin of profit. Competition is stimulated and freed) Tj T*
(from many of its complications and uncertainties to the advantage of) Tj T*
(the seller, the buyer and the public.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is now admitted that, had exchange trading in refined sugar existed) Tj T*
(in 1920, a general use of the exchange by all branches of the trade) Tj T*
(might have prevented, to a considerable extent, the abnormal advance in) Tj T*
(sugar prices of that period, with the hardship and misfortune that) Tj T*
(attended.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The fact that an exchange always provides a buyer and a seller, _at a) Tj T*
(price_, tends toward keeping business fluid. Jobbers are able to) Tj T*
(protect their future requirements. Producers are sure of a market for) Tj T*
(their crops. Crop financing is made easier because bankers are more) Tj T*
(willing to loan on crops sold in advance--an operation made possible by) Tj T*
(an exchange.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Exchanges operate to take the gamble out of business. They help to put) Tj T*
(and maintain business on a sound basis. That some people who have no) Tj T*
(real interest in the commodity use the exchange speculatively does not) Tj T*
(alter this fact.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In providing machinery by which speculative risks incident to a) Tj T*
(jobber's business may be shifted from the jobber to those who make a) Tj T*
(business of assuming such risks, exchanges help to stabilize his) Tj T*
(business and to remove a large part of the destructive uncertainty with) Tj T*
(which he would otherwise have to contend.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Exchanges are the creations of modern economic development, designed) Tj T*
(and operated for the benefit of the commerce, industry and people of) Tj T*
(the civilized world.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Therefore we welcome trading in refined sugar futures and the) Tj T*
(opportunity to offer you the advantages that may be derived from a) Tj T*
(conservative, intelligent use of its services.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
