() Tj T*
(Another way of looking at this is to add the loss of 2.00 on the sale) Tj T*
(of your futures to 4.00, the cost of your actual sugar, making 6.00,) Tj T*
(the price upon which you had based your plans. If you had waited, you) Tj T*
(would have been able to get your sugar for 4.00, but by buying it ahead) Tj T*
