(cost.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is essentially a "playing-safe" operation. It results in profit) Tj T*
(insurance for the jobber who is willing to sacrifice the possibility of) Tj T*
(a speculative gain on advance sales to customers. It is thoroughly) Tj T*
(sound business policy and is neither expensive nor difficult to carry) Tj T*
(out.) Tj T*
