(we have arrived at an arbitrary figure to represent the normal) Tj T*
(differential between refiners' prices and exchange quotations. We) Tj T*
(believe that 57в will serve as a safe basis for calculation, but 58в or) Tj T*
(59в might be equally--or more--accurate. In fact, anyone is entitled to) Tj T*
(an opinion. 57в is our opinion. It is not an average of freight rates,) Tj T*
(but is an arbitrary figure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
