(The Function of the Sugar Broker) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If you should organize your company so that it could attend to all the) Tj T*
(details of sugar buying economically, you would probably still profit) Tj T*
(from the assistance of a sugar broker whose specialty is sugar buying,) Tj T*
(whose horizon is a sugar horizon, whose thoughts are sugar thoughts and) Tj T*
(who must necessarily know more about sugar than the average buyer would) Tj T*
(ever consider it desirable to know.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The sugar broker's service to you is unaffected by prices--his prices) Tj T*
(and all other brokers' prices are the Exchange prices; his commissions) Tj T*
(are based on the same percentages as all other brokers' commissions.) Tj T*
(His only distinction can come from the actual service he can render.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
