(knowledge of economic fundamentals and a perspective upon and contact) Tj T*
(with world activities as they affect all phases of the business of) Tj T*
(sugar, his service will be many times more valuable than if he were) Tj T*
(limited by a small organization, by a definite locality or by) Tj T*
(experience in only a few phases of this business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
