(service worth the name. To give service in accordance with the highest) Tj T*
(modern standards, he must stand as an adviser, as a constant seeker) Tj T*
(after opportunities which will benefit his clients, as a partner whose) Tj T*
(interest in his clients' profits and progress equals his interest in) Tj T*
(his own.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
