(Raw Sugar Futures) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Prior to the inauguration of trading in Refined Futures, Raw Sugar) Tj T*
(Futures were used by many jobbers for hedging and protecting their) Tj T*
(Refined requirements.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The theory of operation is that the raw price will be about equivalent) Tj T*
(to the refined price after duty and the charge for refining are added.) Tj T*
(While the Raw Sugar market will at times get out of line with refined,) Tj T*
(both favorably and unfavorably, this cannot continue for any long) Tj T*
(period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When the Raw Futures market is favorably out of line, it may be more to) Tj T*
(your advantage to use this market, rather than the Refined Futures) Tj T*
(market. At the present time there is the added advantage that the) Tj T*
(volume of trading is greater in Raw than in Refined.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When buying or selling Raw Sugar Futures, you may figure that the) Tj T*
(variation on a minimum lot of 50 tons would be equivalent to the same) Tj T*
(variation of 1120 bags or 320 barrels.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We give you below herewith details of contract and trading conditions:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All contracts for future delivery shall be for 50 tons of 2,240 pounds) Tj T*
(each and multiples thereof.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CONTRACTS: Sold for ... to ..., 50 tons of 2,240 pounds each of sugar) Tj T*
(in bags, deliverable from licensed warehouse in the port of New York,) Tj T*
(between the first and last days of ... inclusive. The delivery within) Tj T*
(such time to be at seller's option, upon 7, 8 or 9 days' notice to the) Tj T*
(buyer. The sugar to be of any grade or grades of Raw sugars based on) Tj T*
(Cuban Centrifugal of 96 degrees average polarization outturn at the) Tj T*
(price of ... cents per pound in bond, net cash with additions or) Tj T*
(deductions for other grades according to the rates of the New York) Tj T*
(Coffee and Sugar Exchange, Inc., existing upon the afternoon of the day) Tj T*
(previous to the date of notice of delivery, and shall embrace all) Tj T*
(Centrifugals first running. The foreign sugars deliverable other than) Tj T*
(Cuban Centrifugals, are: Centrifugals from British West Indies,) Tj T*
(Demerara, Surinam, San Domingo, Brazil, Peru, Java, Mauritius,) Tj T*
(Venezuela and Haiti, all basis of 96 degrees average polarization) Tj T*
(outturn at .2512 cents per pound \(difference in duty\) less; but no lot) Tj T*
(of 50 tons is to consist of sugar from more than one country of origin.) Tj T*
